HumanMarkup((1)) is a project to use XML to "frame and embed contextual human characteristics including physical, cultural, social, kinesic, psychological, and intentional features within conveyed information". Thus it covers some of the same territory already trod by lojban.

Its interesting to see how another group approaches the same problem.  They may also point out options that lojban has overlooked.

Stripped of the technology, their efforts so far have yielded.

