(I find the Political mapping ludicrous in the extreme. But perhaps this cathedral needs a few ''gargoyles''... --''la maikl.'')

I agree. I also find that the jobs need things like ''cizen'' at the very least! - mi'e. ((kreig.daniyl.)), who is one

''A language project from a bunch of techies and no slot for "libertarian" ideology as distinct from liberal and conservative? How believable is that? Any real gang of geeks would have "100 words for Libertarian" (anarcho-capitalist, minarchist, Objectivist (subtypes Neo Tech, Peikoff, and Kelley), etc, etc) --xod''

On the other hand, it would be interesting to come up with Lojban equivalents for the Gestures listed...
